  "title": "Chesapeake Utilities Corporation Raises Dividend by 7.3 Percent",
  "summary": "Dover, Delaware – At their meeting held today, the Board of Directors of Chesapeake Utilities Corporation (NYSE: CPK) voted to increase the quarterly cash dividend on the Company’s common stock from $0.685 per share to $0.735 per share. The Board’s action raises the 2026 annualized dividend by $0.20 from $2.74 to $2.94 per share, a [...] The post Chesapeake Utilities Corporation Raises Dividend by 7.3 Percent appeared first on Chesapeake Utilities Corporation .",
